  "summary": "Malicious code in casino-instant (npm)",
  "details": "Casino-instant@1.0.0 is an SEO-spam package: its only code file (index.js) is an empty module (`module.exports = {}`), and the package ships a French-language README of casino-affiliate marketing content for instantcasinofrance[.]com. It declares no lifecycle scripts, no executables, and no dependencies. The package provides no functional code and appears to be a low-effort spam/SEO artifact rather than a working library.",
